---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import AttackDiagram from "../components/AttackDiagram.astro";
import carImg from "../assets/car.png";
import houseImg from "../assets/house.png";
import mapImg from "../assets/map.png";
---

<Layout>
	<div
		class="w-full min-h-screen bg-[#effbfe] text-[#071a27] font-sans antialiased"
	>
		<main
			class="max-w-[1120px] mx-auto pt-[54px] pr-[92px] pb-[160px] pl-[30px] [@media(max-width:768px)]:p-4 [@media(max-width:768px)]:pb-[90px]"
		>
			<!-- HERO / INTRODUCTION -->
			<section class="max-w-[970px] scroll-mt-7" id="introduction">
				<div
					class="mb-[7px] text-[#079bcf] text-[12px] font-bold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase"
				>
					Parcours d’acculturation à la cybersécurité
				</div>
				<h1
					class="mb-[11px] text-[#071923] text-[clamp(38px,5vw,66px)] leading-[0.96] tracking-[-0.065em] font-bold"
				>
					Introduction
				</h1>
				<p
					class="max-w-[900px] text-[#39505b] text-[20px] leading-[1.68] m-0"
				>
					Les enjeux de la cybersécurité sont aujourd’hui partout :
					dans nos usages, nos outils et les services que nous
					utilisons chaque jour. Ce parcours propose une lecture
					simple et concrète de situations réelles pour mieux
					reconnaître les risques, adopter les bons réflexes et
					protéger les données qui comptent.
				</p>

				<figure
					class="w-full max-w-[915px] my-[28px] mx-0 mb-[100px] py-[28px] px-[33px] pb-[16px] rounded-[14px] bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.84)] border border-[rgba(157,210,225,0.6)] shadow-[0_17px_32px_rgba(79,156,178,0.12),0_2px_7px_rgba(62,123,141,0.08)]"
				>
					<div
						class="overflow-hidden aspect-[16/8.5] bg-[#061521] border-[8px] border-[#09121a] shadow-[0_4px_0_rgba(2,13,21,0.35)]"
					>
						<video
							class="block w-full h-full object-cover"
							src="https://api.preview.4hfactory.tech/storage/companies/2_6BZLRA9PU5/1486_XB5J2PAIOL/7320_19GEQTXSKH.webm"
							controls
							playsinline
							preload="metadata"
							aria-label="Vidéo d’introduction au parcours"
						></video>
					</div>
					<figcaption
						class="mt-3 text-[#7d969f] text-[9px] text-center"
					>
						Regarder la vidéo d’introduction
					</figcaption>
				</figure>
			</section>

			<!-- CAS 1 -->
			<section class="max-w-[990px] mb-[116px] scroll-mt-7" id="cas-1">
				<div class="flex mb-2 gap-7 flex-column">
					<h2
						class="m-0 text-[#081924] text-[clamp(25px,3vw,36px)] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.052em] font-bold"
					>
						01 - STARLINK <em class="text-[#1b70d3] not-italic"
							>Subaru</em
						>
					</h2>
					<p
						class="text-[#08a1d4] text-[15px] font-(Segoe UI) font-bold tracking-[0.13em] uppercase mb-5 border-2 border-[#08a1d4] rounded-[50px] px-2 py-1 inline-block"
					>
						2025
					</p>
				</div>

				<p
					class="max-w-[900px] mb-[10px] text-[#46606b] text-[18px] leading-[1.65] m-0"
				>
					Dans ce premier cas, nous allons observer comment un service
					connecté peut exposer des informations sensibles. En
					comprenant le chemin parcouru par une donnée, il devient
					plus facile d’identifier les points de vigilance et de
					limiter la surface d’exposition.
				</p>
				<p class="mb-4 text-[#0879ae] text-[17px] font-bold">
					Entrez dans la peau de l’attaquant : lancez la simulation et
					observez ce qui se passe.
				</p>

				<!-- TERMINAL / SIMULATION INTERACTIVE -->
				<div
					class="overflow-hidden rounded-[13px] bg-[#061d2b] border border-[rgba(157,210,225,0.6)] shadow-[0_17px_32px_rgba(79,156,178,0.12),0_2px_7px_rgba(62,123,141,0.08)]"
				>
					<div
						class="flex items-center justify-between h-[48px] px-5 border-b border-[rgba(153,227,218,0.13)] text-[#72a69e] text-[15px] font-mono leading-none"
					>
						<div class="flex items-center gap-[10px]">
							<span
								class="w-[12px] h-[12px] rounded-full opacity-90 bg-[#de6e7e]"
							></span>
							<span
								class="w-[12px] h-[12px] rounded-full opacity-90 bg-[#ebb35c]"
							></span>
							<span
								class="w-[12px] h-[12px] rounded-full opacity-90 bg-[#68c798]"
							></span>
						</div>
						<span
							class="text-center tracking-[0.03em] flex-1 font-bold text-[16px] text-[#86c5bc]"
							>portal.subaru-starlink.internal/vehicle/access</span
						>
						<button
							id="reset-sim"
							class="text-[22px] hover:text-white cursor-pointer transition-colors px-2"
							title="Recommencer">⟳</button
						>
					</div>

					<div
						id="sim-screen"
						class="min-h-[460px] p-8 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_0%,rgba(11,100,106,0.18),transparent_54%)] font-mono flex flex-col justify-center items-center"
					>
						<!-- ÉTAPE 0 -->
						<div
							id="sim-step-0"
							class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-full"
						>
							<div class="text-[#b2d5ce] text-[17px] mb-6">
								$ initiate <span class="text-[#61daa9]"
									>vehicle_lookup</span
								> --target starlink
							</div>
							<button
								id="start-sim-btn"
								class="py-5 px-11 border border-[#38b06c] rounded-xl text-[#38b06c] bg-[#10382b] font-mono text-[18px] font-bold cursor-pointer transition-all duration-200 hover:brightness-125 shadow-xl"
								type="button"
							>
								Rechercher le véhicule
							</button>
							<div
								class="mt-6 text-[15px] text-[#b2d5ce] flex items-center gap-2.5"
							>
								<span
									class="inline-block w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#68c798] animate-pulse"
								></span> simulation prête
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- ÉTAPE 1 -->
						<div
							id="sim-step-1"
							class="hidden w-full max-w-[800px] grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-auto animate-[fadeIn_0.5s_ease-out]"
						>
							<div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
								<span
									class="text-[#72a69e] text-[15px] font-bold"
									>Nom de famille</span
								>
								<div
									class="py-5 px-6 border border-[#38b06c] rounded-[12px] bg-[#0a251d] text-[#61daa9] text-[18px] font-semibold shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(56,176,108,0.25)] animate-[slideUp_0.4s_ease-out]"
								>
									佐藤 (SATO)
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
								<span
									class="text-[#72a69e] text-[15px] font-bold"
									>Code postal</span
								>
								<div
									class="py-5 px-6 border border-[#38b06c] rounded-[12px] bg-[#0a251d] text-[#61daa9] text-[18px] font-semibold shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(56,176,108,0.25)] animate-[slideUp_0.4s_ease-out_0.2s_both]"
								>
									154-0004
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- ÉTAPE 2 -->
						<div
							id="sim-step-2"
							class="hidden w-full grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-auto"
						>
							<!-- Vignette 1 : Carte GPS intégrant mapImg -->
							<div
								class="border border-[#38b06c] rounded-[14px] bg-[#0a251d]/90 p-5 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(56,176,108,0.15)] flex flex-col justify-between animate-[slideUp_0.4s_ease-out]"
							>
								<div
									class="text-[#72a69e] text-[14px] font-bold mb-3"
								>
									Subaru Impreza 2023 -- Historique
									localisation
								</div>
								<div
									class="relative h-[150px] bg-[#122e25] rounded overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center border border-[#38b06c]/30"
								>
									<!-- Remplacement ou enrichissement du fond par l'image map.png importée -->
									<img
										src={mapImg.src}
										alt="Carte de localisation"
										class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-60"
									/>
									<div
										class="w-5 h-5 bg-orange-500 rounded-full animate-ping absolute z-10"
									>
									</div>
									<div
										class="w-4 h-4 bg-orange-500 rounded-full absolute z-10"
									>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							<!-- Vignette 2 : Historique adresses -->
							<div
								class="border border-[#38b06c] rounded-[14px] bg-[#0a251d]/90 p-5 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(56,176,108,0.15)] flex flex-col justify-between animate-[slideUp_0.4s_ease-out_0.15s_both]"
							>
								<div
									class="text-[#72a69e] text-[14px] font-bold mb-3"
								>
									Subaru Impreza 2023 -- Historique
									localisation
								</div>
								<div
									class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-[13px] text-[#b2d5ce]"
								>
									<div
										class="flex justify-between py-1.5 border-b border-[#38b06c]/20"
									>
										<span>CHŪŌ-DŌRI (中央通り)</span><span
											class="text-[#38b06c] font-semibold"
											>14/03/2026 : 07:52</span
										>
									</div>
									<div
										class="flex justify-between py-1.5 border-b border-[#38b06c]/20"
									>
										<span>KICHIJŌJI KITA-DŌRI</span><span
											class="text-[#38b06c] font-semibold"
											>14/03/2026 : 08:41</span
										>
									</div>
									<div
										class="flex justify-between py-1.5 border-b border-[#38b06c]/20"
									>
										<span>ROUTE VERS LE PARC</span><span
											class="text-[#38b06c] font-semibold"
											>14/03/2026 : 09:03</span
										>
									</div>
									<div class="flex justify-between py-1.5">
										<span>CHŪŌ-DŌRI (中央通り)</span><span
											class="text-[#38b06c] font-semibold"
											>14/03/2026 : 16:00</span
										>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							<!-- Vignette 3 : Contrôle véhicule -->
							<div
								class="border border-[#38b06c] rounded-[14px] bg-[#0a251d]/90 p-5 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(56,176,108,0.15)] flex flex-col justify-center items-center gap-4 animate-[slideUp_0.4s_ease-out_0.3s_both]"
							>
								<div
									class="text-[#72a69e] text-[14px] font-bold self-start"
								>
									Subaru Impreza 2023 -- Contrôle du véhicule
								</div>
								<button
									class="w-full py-3 bg-[#1b4e3d] text-[#61daa9] rounded-lg text-[15px] font-extrabold border border-[#38b06c] hover:bg-[#38b06c] hover:text-[#061d2b] transition-colors cursor-pointer shadow-md"
									>DÉMARRER</button
								>
								<button
									class="w-full py-3 bg-[#4e1b1b] text-[#da6161] rounded-lg text-[15px] font-extrabold border border-[#da6161] hover:bg-[#da6161] hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-pointer shadow-md"
									>DÉVERROUILLER</button
								>
							</div>

							<!-- Vignette 4 : Infos personnelles -->
							<div
								class="border border-[#38b06c] rounded-[14px] bg-[#0a251d]/90 p-5 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(56,176,108,0.15)] flex flex-col justify-between animate-[slideUp_0.4s_ease-out_0.45s_both]"
							>
								<div
									class="text-[#72a69e] text-[14px] font-bold mb-2"
								>
									Subaru Impreza 2023 -- Infos personnelles
								</div>
								<div
									class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-[13px] text-[#b2d5ce]"
								>
									<div>
										<div
											class="text-[#38b06c] mb-1 font-semibold"
										>
											090-1234-5678
										</div>
										<div
											class="text-[#38b06c] font-semibold"
										>
											080-4567-1234
										</div>
										<div
											class="text-[#38b06c] mt-2 font-semibold"
										>
											03-1234-5678
										</div>
									</div>
									<div
										class="border-l border-[#38b06c]/30 pl-3"
									>
										<div
											class="text-[11px] text-[#72a69e] font-bold"
										>
											ADRESSE
										</div>
										<div class="leading-tight mt-1">
											〒154-0004<br
											/>東京都世田谷区太子堂1-2-3<br
											/>サンプルマンション201号室
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div
									class="mt-3 pt-2 border-t border-[#38b06c]/30 text-[13px]"
								>
									<span
										class="text-[#72a69e] text-[11px] font-bold block"
										>暗証番号 (ANSHŌ BANGŌ) - PIN VÉHICULE</span
									>
									<span
										class="text-[#38b06c] font-black text-[15px]"
										>1234</span
									>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- GRILLE DES STATS ET VIDÉO -->
				<div
					class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-8 [@media(max-width:768px)]:grid-cols-1"
				>
					<div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
						<!-- BLOC LOCALISATION -->
						<div
							class="bg-white rounded-[20px] p-5 shadow-[0_10px_25px_rgba(11,40,80,0.05)]"
						>
							<div class="flex items-baseline gap-[10px] mb-3">
								<strong
									class="text-[32px] font-extrabold text-[#2a6cf5] leading-none"
									>5</strong
								>
								<span
									class="text-[10px] font-extrabold text-black tracking-[0.08em]"
									>MÈTRES DE LOCALISATION PRÉCISE</span
								>
							</div>
							<div
								class="flex items-center justify-between pt-[10px] px-[10px] pb-0"
							>
								<img
									src={carImg.src}
									alt="Subaru bleue"
									class="h-[45px] w-auto object-contain"
								/>
								<div
									class="flex-1 h-[0.5px] bg-[#4182f7] mx-4 relative before:content-[''] before:absolute before:-top-[3px] before:left-0 before:border-solid before:border-y-transparent before:border-r-[#4182f7] before:border-y-[4px] before:border-r-[6px] before:border-l-0 after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-top-[3px] after:right-0 after:border-solid after:border-y-transparent after:border-l-[#4182f7] after:border-y-[4px] after:border-l-[6px] after:border-r-0"
								>
								</div>
								<img
									src={houseImg.src}
									alt="Maison"
									class="h-[60px] w-auto object-contain"
								/>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- SOUS-GRILLE 2 CARTE -->
						<div
							class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-5 [@media(max-width:768px)]:grid-cols-1"
						>
							<div
								class="bg-white rounded-[20px] p-5 shadow-[0_10px_25px_rgba(11,40,80,0.05)] flex flex-col justify-between"
							>
								<div
									class="flex items-baseline gap-[10px] mb-3"
								>
									<strong
										class="text-[32px] font-extrabold text-[#2a6cf5] leading-none"
										>3</strong
									>
									<span
										class="text-[10px] font-extrabold text-black tracking-[0.08em]"
										>PAYS CONCERNÉS</span
									>
								</div>
								<div
									class="flex items-end justify-between gap-2 mt-3"
								>
									<div
										class="flex flex-col items-center gap-[6px]"
									>
										<img
											src="src/assets/canada.svg"
											alt="Canada"
											class="w-6 h-4 object-cover rounded-[2px] shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)]"
										/>
										<span
											class="text-[8px] font-extrabold text-[#2a6cf5]"
											>CANADA</span
										>
									</div>
									<div
										class="flex flex-col items-center gap-[6px]"
									>
										<img
											src="src/assets/usa.svg"
											alt="États-Unis"
											class="w-6 h-4 object-cover rounded-[2px] shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)]"
										/>
										<span
											class="text-[8px] font-extrabold text-[#2a6cf5]"
											>ETATS-UNIS</span
										>
									</div>
									<div
										class="flex flex-col items-center gap-[6px]"
									>
										<img
											src="src/assets/japan.svg"
											alt="Japon"
											class="w-6 h-4 object-cover rounded-[2px] shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)]"
										/>
										<span
											class="text-[8px] font-extrabold text-[#2a6cf5]"
											>JAPON</span
										>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div
								class="bg-white rounded-[20px] p-5 shadow-[0_10px_25px_rgba(11,40,80,0.05)] flex flex-col justify-between"
							>
								<div
									class="flex items-baseline gap-[10px] mb-3"
								>
									<strong
										class="text-[32px] font-extrabold text-[#2a6cf5] leading-none"
										>4</strong
									>
									<span
										class="text-[10px] font-extrabold text-black tracking-[0.08em]"
										>INFORMATIONS POUR ENTRER</span
									>
								</div>
								<div
									class="w-[50px] h-[18px] bg-[#dcdcdc] rounded-[6px] mt-3"
								>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- CARTE VIDÉO DEMO -->
					<div
						class="bg-white rounded-[20px] p-4 shadow-[0_10px_25px_rgba(11,40,80,0.05)] flex flex-col justify-between"
					>
						<div
							class="w-full aspect-[16/9] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-black"
						>
							<iframe
								class="w-full h-full border-0"
								src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/0i8juy6RPBI?si=LSWO_fELUqUtbnr9"
								title="Démo Subaru"
								allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
								allowfullscreen></iframe>
						</div>
						<figcaption
							class="mt-[14px] text-[14px] text-[#7288a2] text-center leading-[1.4]"
						>
							Prise de contrôle d’une Subaru en utilisant la
							plaque d’immatriculation en environ 10 secondes
						</figcaption>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- CAS 2 -->
			<section class="max-w-[990px] mb-[116px] scroll-mt-7" id="cas-2">
				<div class="flex items-baseline gap-[10px] mb-4">
					<span
						class="text-[#08a1d4] text-[12px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.13em] uppercase"
						>02</span
					>
					<h2
						class="m-0 text-[#081924] text-[clamp(25px,3vw,36px)] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.052em] font-bold"
					>
						Cas 2 - Attaque de l’homme du milieu <em
							class="text-[#1b70d3] not-italic">BMW</em
						>
					</h2>
				</div>
				<p
					class="max-w-[900px] mb-[10px] text-[#46606b] text-[18px] leading-[1.65] m-0"
				>
					Deux chercheurs en sécurité ont découvert une faille dans le
					service connecté d’un constructeur automobile. Cette
					démonstration permet de comprendre comment une
					fonctionnalité pratique peut devenir un vecteur d’exposition
					lorsqu’elle n’est pas suffisamment protégée.
				</p>
				<p class="mb-4 text-[#0879ae] text-[17px] font-bold">
					Explorez le scénario puis retenez une idée essentielle : une
					donnée utile doit aussi rester maîtrisée.
				</p>

				<AttackDiagram />

				<!-- BLOCS MÉTRIQUES CAS 2 -->
				<div
					class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-[960px] mx-auto mt-10"
				>
					<div
						class="min-h-[150px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 rounded-[20px] bg-white border border-[rgba(157,210,225,0.6)] shadow-[0_17px_32px_rgba(79,156,178,0.12),0_2px_7px_rgba(62,123,141,0.08)] text-center transition-transform"
					>
						<strong
							id="vehicle-counter"
							class="text-[#3680d7] text-[42px] font-extrabold leading-none"
							data-target="2200000">0</strong
						>
						<span
							class="mt-2 text-[#1768b8] text-[17px] font-extrabold"
							>de véhicules concernés</span
						>
					</div>

					<div
						class="min-h-[150px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 rounded-[20px] bg-white border border-[rgba(157,210,225,0.6)] shadow-[0_17px_32px_rgba(79,156,178,0.12),0_2px_7px_rgba(62,123,141,0.08)] text-center transition-transform"
					>
						<span
